  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "はねを　うちあわせて　はっか。\nかれいな　ステップを　ふみながら\nはげしい　ほのおを　あびせかけるぞ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "날개를 부딪쳐서 발화시킨다.\n화려한 스텝을 밟으면서\n격렬한 불꽃을 퍼붓는다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "拍打翅膀生火。\n一邊踩著華麗的步伐，\n一邊灑下猛烈的火焰。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il réunit ses ailes pour générer du feu.\nSa chorégraphie envoûtante noie l’ennemi\nsous un torrent de flammes.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Schlägt es mit den Flügeln, gibt es Zunder!\nMit eleganten Ausfallschritten lässt es dann\nFeuer auf seine Gegner herabregnen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Junta las alas y lanza voraces llamas al rival.\nSu ataque se asemeja a una elaborada\ncoreografía de fuego.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Genera del fuoco congiungendo le ali.\nAvvolge il nemico con violente fiamme mentre\nsi esibisce in un’elegante coreografia di danza.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It beats its wings together to create fire.\nAs it moves in the steps of its beautiful dance,\nit bathes opponents in intense flames.",
